---
title: Ham and Vegetable Casserole
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Casseroles
cook time: 1 hour 30 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@canned tomatoes{3%cups}
@sugar{1%Tbsp}
@bay leaf{1}
@ham{1%slice} (3/4 inch thick, cubed)
@rice, uncooked{0.5%cup}
@carrots, sliced{3}
@onions, chopped{3}

Cook tomatoes, sugar, and bay leaf for 10 minutes. Then remove bay leaf. Arrange ham, rice, carrots, and onions in layers. Bake at 350 degrees for 1 1/2 hours.
